ly.</string><string name="safety_transformer_dont">Do not dismantle or connect to electricity.</string><string name="safety_transformer_audio">Transformer safety. Keep dry. Do not connect to electricity.</string><string name="safety_capacitor_do">Discharge only by a trained person and store safely.</string><string name="safety_capacitor_dont">Do not touch terminals or test with bare hands.</string><string name="safety_capacitor_audio">Capacitor safety. Do not touch terminals.</string><string name="safety_other_do">Separate unknown hazardous parts and ask for help.</string><string name="safety_other_dont">Do not burn, mix, or throw hazardous parts in household waste.</string><string name="safety_other_audio">Safety. Separate hazardous parts. Do not burn or mix them.</string>
